# TODO / Future Work

Thanks for your interest in contributing! 🎉  
Feel free to work on any item in this list to help improve the project.

---

## Multi-Device Architecture (High Priority)

To support more Bluetooth devices, introduce a **driver (adapter) architecture**.

- Define a generic interface for common actions:
  - `connect()`, `getData()`, `setTime()`, `setAlarm()`, etc.
- Implement device-specific drivers that handle Bluetooth communication and data formats
- Refactor existing logic into this structure

This will make it easier to add support for new devices.

---

## UI & Theme Support

- The project currently supports **dark mode only**.
- Add a **light and dark modes** theme.
- Allow users to switch between light and dark modes.


---

## Display Estimated Burned Calories

- The app currently displays activity points retrieved from a fitness tracker.
- Extend this by estimating calories burned based on these points and user profile data.
- This may include:
  - Introduce a user profile including attributes such as weight, height, age, and gender.
  - Use this data to calculate Basal Metabolic Rate (BMR).
  - Estimate resting calories burned so far today using: BMR × (hours since midnight / 24)
  - Convert activity points into additional calories using a profile-based formula.
  - Calculate total calories burned as: resting calories + activity calories
  - Display the total estimated calories in the UI.

